{'symbol': 'BSX', 'date': '2021-05-18 03:00:00', 'title': 'LATE-BREAKING REGISTRY DATA AT EUROPCR CONGRESS DEMONSTRATE REDUCED PARAVALVULAR LEAK AND LOW PERMANENT PACEMAKER RATES FOR THE ACURATE NEO2™ AORTIC VALVE SYSTEM', 'text': 'MARLBOROUGH, MASS., MAY 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DATA PRESENTED AT HOTLINE AND LATE-BREAKING TRIAL SESSIONS TODAY AT THE EUROPCR 2021 CONGRESS DEMONSTRATED\xa0POSITIVE PROCEDURAL PERFORMANCE, INCLUDING LOW RATES OF PARAVALVULAR LEAKAGE (PVL) AND PERMANENT PACEMAKER IMPLEMENTATION (PPI), OF THE BOSTON SCIENTIFIC (NYSE: BSX) ACURATE\xa0NEO2™\xa0AORTIC VALVE SYSTEM\xa0WITHIN THE\xa0INVESTIGATOR-INITIATED EARLY NEO2 REGISTRY1 AND ITAL-NEO REGISTRY2 STUDIES.'}